. reshape long lemp, i(indusid) j(year)
(j = 1997 1998 1999 2000 2001 2002 2004 2005)

Data                               Wide   ->   Long
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations              103   ->   824         
Number of variables                  26   ->   20          
j variable (8 values)                     ->   year
xij variables:
         lemp1997 lemp1998 ... lemp2005   ->   lemp
